 "nl": [
  "Allow database to connect to edge-cache using RTSP (TCP 554) and SSH (TCP 22) and NTP (UDP 123).",
  "Hosts in partners may reach iot-sensors over MySQL (TCP 3306) and NTP (UDP 123) and RTSP (TCP 554).",
  "Hosts in dev-lab may reach iot-sensors over SMB (TCP 445).",
  "engineering must accept PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) and IMAP (TCP 143) from admin.",
  "Allow partners to connect to cameras using SMB (TCP 445) and RTSP (TCP 554) and RDP (TCP 3389).",
  "Hosts in monitoring may reach partners over LDAP (TCP 389) and HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "Allow partners to connect to iot-sensors using SMTP (TCP 25) and RTSP (TCP 554) and syslog (UDP 514).",
  "student-lab must never reach partners, regardless of any other rule.",
  "Deny all traffic from edge-cache to monitoring (this overrides any public service).",
  "Allow engineering to connect to admin using IMAP (TCP 143) and SMTP (TCP 25).",
  "Make NTP (UDP 123) on edge-cache reachable from all internal zones.",
  "No packet from admin may enter dev-lab, even for services open to everyone.",
  "engineering offers HTTP (TCP 80) and NTP (UDP 123) to every zone.",
  "Restrict partners so that its only permitted destinations are admin on HTTPS (TCP 443); drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "Allow monitoring to connect to iot-sensors using HTTPS (TCP 443) and RTSP (TCP 554).",
  "Hosts in engineering may reach cameras over RTSP (TCP 554)."
 ],
